{{- /*
  "Is this a headless (no desktop) machine?" -- returns "true" or "false".

  Desktop Linux means Omarchy here. That is the only Linux desktop this repo
  currently targets, so headless is simply "Linux that is not Omarchy" and
  needs no prompt. macOS and Windows always have a desktop.

  If another Linux desktop ever shows up, widen this test then. Not before.
*/ -}}
{{- if ne .chezmoi.os "linux" -}}
false
{{- else -}}
{{- ne (includeTemplate "is-omarchy" .) "true" -}}
{{- end -}}
